title: "ocr: scene-text detection & recognition (EAST + CRNN) built on the BaseModel interface"
abstract: >-
  Optical Character Recognition toolkit combining scene-text detection (EAST) and
  text recognition (CRNN), built on the `BaseModel` interface with keras-free
  runtimes — part of the yui-mhcp projects.
